{
  "about": "What a guard of each type perceives and how fast it becomes aware, and the events every guard notices (T70 added the creep, the takedown, the radio report and the check-in carried by radio -- radios are heard along the level like the rest, louder -- the alarm, a guard's shot, and a partner gone quiet, which no one hears but the guard who notices the silence): every number the infiltration example tunes, one row per type, as Crysis keeps its archetypes in data (Welsh 2013). The sources for each field are in docs/concepts/stealth-ai.md; the per-phase decays T70 added (searching and alert) are the kit's own, set by measuring. Distances are metres, times seconds, shares 0 to 1.",
